"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Spain said most people who tried to enter the country had returned to Morocco by Friday evening. Italy stopped its agreement with Spain that allows free movement between the countries.\",            \"english_title\": \"Spain and Italy Border Update\",            \"translated_version\": \"Espa\u00f1a dijo que la mayor\u00eda de las personas que intentaron entrar al pa\u00eds regresaron a Marruecos el viernes por la noche. Italia par\u00f3 su acuerdo con Espa\u00f1a que permite movimiento libre entre los pa\u00edses.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Actualizaci\u00f3n de Frontera Espa\u00f1a e Italia\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Donald Trump announced an agreement that he said was an important step towards having a new Palestinian government in Gaza. However, the situation is very complicated because of politics, war, and the destruction in Gaza.\",            \"english_title\": \"Trump's Announcement on Gaza\",            \"translated_version\": \"Donald Trump anunci\u00f3 un acuerdo que dijo era un paso importante para tener un nuevo gobierno palestino en Gaza. Pero, la situaci\u00f3n es muy complicada por la pol\u00edtica, la guerra, y la destrucci\u00f3n en Gaza.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Anuncio de Trump sobre Gaza\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Around 500 people, mostly tourists, were evacuated by boat from Agios Vasileios after they got trapped.\",            \"english_title\": \"Tourists Evacuated by Boat\",            \"translated_version\": \"Alrededor de 500 personas, la mayor\u00eda turistas, fueron evacuadas en barco de Agios Vasileios despu\u00e9s de quedar atrapadas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Turistas Evacuados en Barco\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The bodies of two climbers have been found on a mountain, but others are still missing.\",            \"english_title\": \"Climbers Found on Mountain\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los cuerpos de dos escaladores fueron encontrados en una monta\u00f1a, pero otros todav\u00eda est\u00e1n desaparecidos.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Escaladores Encontrados en Monta\u00f1a\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"At least 18 people drowned while trying to swim to Spanish territory during chaotic scenes at the border.\",            \"english_title\": \"Tragedy at the Border\",            \"translated_version\": \"Al menos 18 personas se ahogaron mientras intentaban nadar al territorio espa\u00f1ol durante escenas ca\u00f3ticas en la frontera.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tragedia en la Frontera\"        }    ]}"